ili9881c: read DSI lane count + HS rate from the DT; drop non-continuous clock

Drive an ILI9881C panel on the StarFive JH7110 cdns-dsi host (VisionFive 2):
 - Read "dsi,lanes" (driver hardcodes 4; this panel + the JH7110 2-lane DSI
   port are 2-lane).
 - Read "dsi,hs-rate" -> dsi->hs_rate. The cdns-dsi host programs the M31 DPHY
   from dsi->hs_rate at the first DSI transfer (panel prepare, before the host
   recomputes the clock at bridge-enable; the vendor bridge has no pre_enable).
   With hs_rate = 0 the M31 PHY matches no PLL entry, programs nothing, and its
   PLL-lock poll busy-waits forever -> silent hard hang at the fbdev modeset.
   The jadard panel driver sets hs_rate for the same reason.
 - Drop MIPI_DSI_CLOCK_NON_CONTINUOUS from am8001280g: the vendor host/PHY were
   only validated with a continuous clock.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board/vendor-kernel integration]

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-ilitek-ili9881c.c	2026-07-14 21:26:56.203827323 +0100
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-ilitek-ili9881c.c	2026-07-14 21:26:56.226063569 +0100
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@
 #include <linux/kernel.h>
 #include <linux/module.h>
 #include <linux/of.h>
+#include <linux/property.h>
 
 #include <linux/gpio/consumer.h>
 #include <linux/regulator/consumer.h>
@@ -1532,6 +1533,18 @@
 	dsi->mode_flags = ctx->desc->mode_flags;
 	dsi->format = MIPI_DSI_FMT_RGB888;
 	dsi->lanes = 4;
+	/* DT overrides: this panel + the JH7110 2-lane DSI port are 2-lane; and
+	 * the cdns-dsi host programs the M31 DPHY from dsi->hs_rate at the FIRST
+	 * DSI transfer (panel prepare, before the host recomputes the clock at
+	 * bridge-enable - the vendor bridge has no pre_enable). With hs_rate 0 the
+	 * M31 PHY matches no PLL entry and its lock poll spins forever -> hang. */
+	device_property_read_u32(&dsi->dev, "dsi,lanes", &dsi->lanes);
+	{
+		u32 hs_rate;
+
+		if (!device_property_read_u32(&dsi->dev, "dsi,hs-rate", &hs_rate))
+			dsi->hs_rate = hs_rate;
+	}
 
 	return mipi_dsi_attach(dsi);
 }
@@ -1587,7 +1600,7 @@
 	.init_length = ARRAY_SIZE(am8001280g_init),
 	.mode = &am8001280g_default_mode,
 	.mode_flags = MIPI_DSI_MODE_VIDEO | MIPI_DSI_MODE_VIDEO_SYNC_PULSE |
-		      MIPI_DSI_CLOCK_NON_CONTINUOUS | MIPI_DSI_MODE_LPM,
+		      MIPI_DSI_MODE_LPM,
 };
 
 static const struct of_device_id ili9881c_of_match[] = {
